$DATUM 7-Amino-2-benzyl-N,4-dimethyl-1,3-dioxo-2,3-dihydro-1H-pyrrolo[
3,4-c]pyridine-6-carboxamide (2g). A solution of 2b (100 mg, 0.32 mmol),
methylamine (0.32 mL of a 2 M solution in THF, 0.64 mmol), HOBt (50 mg,
0.32 mmol), and EDC (61 mg, 0.32 mmol) in DCM (3 mL) was stirred for 24
h. Water was added to the reaction, followed by EtOAc. The organic layer
was separated, washed with brine, and dried over MgSO4. After filtration
and concentration, the product was purified by preparative HPLC. to
afford 2g (8 mg, 7%). HPLC purity 99%. 1H NMR (400 MHz, CDCl3) δ 8.01 (s,
1H), 7.45-7.23 (m, 5H), 4.79 (s, 2H), 2.99 (d, J = 5.2 Hz, 3H), 2.67 (s,
3H). LC-MS (ESI): m/z 325.1 [M + H]+.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
